  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you kick yourself from your home-world instance, it will lock you in a loading loop for 30-minutes straight, rendering VRChat unplayable. This is a similar principle if you have people vote-kick you within your home-world. This is also problematic as VRChat reduces your user rank points for each time you are kicked from a world instance.",
